249
00:28:25,300 --> 00:28:26,580
Why didn't you answer when you called?

250
00:28:26,840 --> 00:28:27,900
My name's not Platt.

251
00:28:28,300 --> 00:28:29,300
My name is...

252
00:28:29,300 --> 00:28:32,220
Your name is Platt.

253
00:28:35,380 --> 00:28:37,060
Captain, get these niggers to my cart.

254
00:28:43,680 --> 00:29:07,580
I believe I have something very much to your liking in the back room.

255
00:29:07,580 --> 00:29:09,040
Come, follow me, please.

256
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:10,480
Yes.

257
00:29:11,560 --> 00:29:12,840
Inspect them at your leisure.

258
00:29:13,020 --> 00:29:17,520
But I ask you to pay particular regard to young Ezra here.

259
00:29:17,900 --> 00:29:19,160
Incredibly sound limbs.

260
00:29:19,300 --> 00:29:21,220
I have never seen anything quite like him.

261
00:29:21,620 --> 00:29:22,980
And this marvelous creature.

262
00:29:23,060 --> 00:29:23,680
Can you believe it?

263
00:29:24,180 --> 00:29:24,380
Hmm?

264
00:29:24,600 --> 00:29:25,880
Should make a fine lady's maid.

265
00:29:26,060 --> 00:29:26,340
Yes?

266
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:26,720
Madam?

267
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:29,500
So, inspect at your leisure.

268
00:29:29,840 --> 00:29:30,420
Take your time.

269
00:29:30,500 --> 00:29:31,680
Help yourself to refreshments.

270
00:29:32,280 --> 00:29:32,620
Gentlemen.

271
00:29:33,160 --> 00:29:34,440
What catches your fancy here?

272
00:29:35,040 --> 00:29:35,240
Hmm?

273
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:36,140
This boy?

274
00:29:36,540 --> 00:29:36,840
Yes?

275
00:29:36,900 --> 00:29:37,400
Open your mouth.

276
00:29:37,860 --> 00:29:38,140
Open.

277
00:29:38,260 --> 00:29:38,500
Wider.

278
00:29:39,180 --> 00:29:39,700
Look in there.

279
00:29:39,900 --> 00:29:41,500
Never been sick a day in his life.

280
00:29:41,820 --> 00:29:43,460
And I call particular attention to Martha.

281
00:29:43,600 --> 00:29:45,220
She is an excellent pastry cook.

282
00:29:45,800 --> 00:29:46,880
Ah, Mr. Ford.

283
00:29:48,460 --> 00:29:49,700
Splendid seeing you, sir.

284
00:29:49,700 --> 00:29:50,700
What catches your fancy?

285
00:29:50,820 --> 00:29:52,260
This land is very brawny.

286
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:52,640
Yeah?

287
00:29:52,920 --> 00:29:55,380
How much are the ones, Platt and Eliza?

288
00:29:55,620 --> 00:29:56,480
Ah, yes.

289
00:29:57,580 --> 00:29:58,700
A thousand for Platt.

290
00:29:59,300 --> 00:30:02,720
Oh, this is a nigger of considerable talent, I assure you.

291
00:30:02,920 --> 00:30:04,260
Seven hundred for Eliza?

292
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:05,660
My fairest price?

293
00:30:06,980 --> 00:30:07,220
Hmm.

294
00:30:08,600 --> 00:30:09,860
You will accept a note.

295
00:30:10,060 --> 00:30:10,380
Please, sir.

296
00:30:10,380 --> 00:30:11,480
Of course, for real, Mr. Ford.

297
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,520
Do not divide my family.

298
00:30:12,880 --> 00:30:14,240
Do not take me unless you take my choice.

299
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:14,960
Eliza, quiet!

300
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:17,340
You will have the most faithful slave in me.

301
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,900
The most faithful slave that has ever lived.

302
00:30:18,900 --> 00:30:19,900
But I beg that you do not support us.

303
00:30:19,900 --> 00:30:20,620
Your prize for the boy.

304
00:30:20,620 --> 00:30:20,980
Yes, the boy.

305
00:30:21,760 --> 00:30:22,080
Please.

306
00:30:22,080 --> 00:30:24,040
Sir, I will give you something to cry about.

307
00:30:24,120 --> 00:30:24,980
Randall, come forward.

308
00:30:25,120 --> 00:30:26,220
Come, come, come, come, come, come.

309
00:30:26,540 --> 00:30:28,180
Now, you see how fit this boy is.

310
00:30:28,540 --> 00:30:29,840
You know, like ripe fruit.

311
00:30:30,340 --> 00:30:31,820
May I take your stick a moment?

312
00:30:32,680 --> 00:30:33,660
Observe this, Randall.

313
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:34,940
Jump, jump, jump, run, run, run.

314
00:30:35,320 --> 00:30:36,060
Very good.

315
00:30:36,820 --> 00:30:37,180
